{"hash":"*","by":"stand-in planner","searches":0,"data":{"why":"A garden shelter on the lawn: four posts and a roof stand loose, the wind tips them, so a trench is dug along the front and concrete footings are poured under the posts (seen in section in the face), the floor under it turns to mud so paving slabs go down, rain then blows in from the side so a back wall and a side wall go up. The camera opens close on the shelter, stays mid on it and its footings, goes hero on the name and ends on the home view with stepping stones and bushes.","story":{"title":"Garden Shelter","hero":"a garden shelter","parts":["posts","roof","trench","concrete footings","paving slabs","back wall","side wall","stepping stones","bushes"],"ideas":[{"role":"hook","idea":"four posts and a roof on the lawn keep the rain off"},{"role":"problem","idea":"the first gust of wind catches the roof and tips the whole thing"},{"role":"fix1","idea":"dig down and pour concrete footings that hold the posts"},{"role":"problem2","idea":"under the roof, the grass is walked to mud and puddles"},{"role":"fix2","idea":"lay paving slabs for a dry, flat floor"},{"role":"problem3","idea":"the wind blows rain in sideways across the slabs"},{"role":"fix3","idea":"a back wall and a side wall block the wind"},{"role":"name","idea":"this is a garden shelter"},{"role":"fact","idea":"a strong gust pushes about 20 pounds on every square foot of roof"},{"role":"finish","idea":"stepping stones to its door and bushes around it"},{"role":"congrats","idea":"you have built a garden shelter"}],"chain":[{"problem":"problem","causedBy":"hook","shows":"wind arrows hit the shelter and it tips up on one side","stakes":"the shelter could blow away","size":5},{"problem":"problem2","causedBy":"fix1","shows":"puddles spread under the roof","stakes":"you stand in mud","size":4},{"problem":"problem3","causedBy":"fix2","shows":"rain spray blows in across the floor from the side","stakes":"everything inside still gets wet","size":6}],"sur